          0,
          [],
          -1
        ]
      },
      [],
      "Geospatial data used by public-sector, private-sector, and research organizations is commonly kept in enterprise geodatabases and distributed using geospatial data servers. Following successful completion of this course, students will be able to perform tasks typical for early-career positions in such organizations. Topics include creation and maintenance of spatial and non-spatial database tables, construction of basic SQL queries for selection and joins, publication of geospatial services and web apps, and security best practices.",
      []
    ],
